{
  "data": {
    "lines": [
      "import { msm } from \"msm:runtime\";",
      "",
      "const KART = \"msm_examples:go_kart\";",
      "const KART_ITEM = \"msm_examples:go_kart_spawn_egg\";",
      "const HORN = \"msm_examples:kart_horn\";",
      "",
      "// Sneak and use a kart to pick it up again as its item.",
      "msm.events.on(\"entity.interact\", (e) => {",
      "  if (e.entity.type !== KART || !e.player.isSneaking) return;",
      "  e.cancel();",
      "  e.entity.remove();",
      "  if (!e.player.isCreative) e.player.give(KART_ITEM);",
      "  e.world.playSound(\"minecraft:entity.item.pickup\", e.player.pos);",
      "});",
      "",
      "// The horn honks, at most once a second.",
      "msm.events.on(\"item.use\", (e) => {",
      "  if (e.item.id !== HORN) return;",
      "  const ready = e.player.data.get(\"horn_ready\");",
      "  if (typeof ready === \"number\" && e.world.time < ready) return;",
      "  e.player.data.set(\"horn_ready\", e.world.time + 20);",
      "  e.world.playSound(\"minecraft:block.note_block.didgeridoo\", e.player.pos, { volume: 2, pitch: 1.4 });",
      "});"
    ]
  },
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "id": "msm_examples:go_kart_controls",
  "kind": "msm:script",
  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "The go-kart's controls. The entity.interact handler runs before the kart's own use: when the player is sneaking it cancels getting in, removes the kart (remove leaves no loot) and gives back the kart item, msm_examples:go_kart_spawn_egg, unless the player is in creative. The item.use handler honks the horn, keeping the time of the next honk in player.data. Scripts run only in the Fabric mod jar export.",
    "tags": [
      "example",
      "popular-ideas"
    ]
  }
}
